.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-VALIDATE 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-validate \- Validate: parse check, PDF/A conformance, or (unexposed) PDF/UA
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent validate\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-pdfa\fR] [\fB\-\-pdfua\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate: parse check, PDF/A conformance, or (unexposed) PDF/UA
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-pdfa\fR
Validate PDF/A conformance (default profile a2b, see \-\-profile)
.TP
\fB\-\-pdfua\fR
Validate PDF/UA conformance. Accepted and reported: the facade does not expose it
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR [default: a2b]
PDF/A profile for \-\-pdfa
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
a1b: PDF/A\-1b
.IP \(bu 2
a2b: PDF/A\-2b (default)
.IP \(bu 2
a3b: PDF/A\-3b
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input PDF, or `\-` for stdin
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
